{"id": "20503106", "revid": "6146728", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20503106", "title": "Jean Michel (politician)", "text": "Jean Michel (28 January 1949 \u2013 18 March 2025) was a French politician. He was the member of the National Assembly for Puy-de-D\u00f4me's 6th constituency from 1997 to 2012 as a member of the Socialiste, radical, citoyen et divers gauche parliamentary group.\nThe constituency was abolished in the 2010 redistricting, with most of the area moved to Puy-de-D\u00f4me's 2nd constituency. Michel did not seek re-election in the 2012 election.\nMichel died on 18 March 2025, at the age of 76."}
